# cells/: track the small, faultflow-authored JSON cell maps (+ osu035.yml
# config); exclude the large third-party PDK-derived Liberty/behavioral-model
# files (sky130's *.lib alone is ~94MB). git history shows cells/ used to be
# tracked (e.g. "feat(cells): add sky130 adders..."), so this looks like a
# later blanket rule that collaterally swept up the JSON along with the big
# PDK files rather than a deliberate exclusion of the JSON itself.
cells/**/*.lib
cells/**/*.v
parser.out
parsetab.py
config.ofs.example*

